OL,3,GNEWSAPhotographer wins prize with hen
OL,4,Aharrier snaps
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning this story contains some
OL,7,Fgraphic images
OL,9,FA photographer has won a prestigious
OL,10,Faward for his six pictures of hen
OL,11,Fharriers.
OL,13,FConrad Dickinson, from Hexham,
OL,14,FNorthumberland, won the conservation
OL,15,Faward at the 2026 Bird Photographer of
OL,16,Fthe Year competition.
OL,18,FHis images showed the birds thriving in
OL,19,Fthe wild as well as the efforts of the
OL,20,FRSPB to save the species by monitoring
OL,21,Fthem and fitting satellite tags.
